low up and feel like you're begging. You lower your price and still — nothing."}]},{"t":"p","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"It's not your product. It's not your market. And it's definitely not your prices."}]},{"t":"p"},{"t":"p"},{"t":"p","ch":[{"t":"strong","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"It's your sales system. Or rather — the absence of one."}]}]},{"t":"hr"},{"t":"p","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"Most small business owners in Zambia (and across Africa) are running their businesses on hope marketing. Post something on Facebook. Wait. Hope someone buys."}]},{"t":"p","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"That's not a sales strategy. That's a lottery ticket."}]},{"t":"p"},{"t":"p","ch":[{"t":"strong","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"7 Steps to Better Sales Results"}]},{"t":"#text","x":" is the system you've been missing."}]},{"t":"p","ch":[{"t":"#text","x":"Written by Susan Mwenda-Mulongoti — engineer, entrepreneur, and digital marketing consultant who has built, broken, and rebuilt multiple businesses — this book gives you a practical, step-by-step process for selling more without pressure tactics, without begging, and without guessing."}]}]}]},{"t":"div","c":"sc-a0aea947-0 dOqGpd col-sm col col-md col-lg ","a":{"id":""},"ch":[{"t":"div","a":{"style":"position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;height:100%"},"ch":[{"t":"div","a":{"style":"display:block;align-self:center;height:100%"},"ch":[{"t":"img","c":"sc-a0aea947-0 eswxlD undefined undefined","a":{"src":"https://ezycourse.b-cdn.net/1887/cmo4187n8q70nltqr9ls1gfzb.png","alt":"Widget image"}}]}]}]},{"t":"div","c":"sc-a0aea947-0 dOqGpd col-sm-undefined col-undefined col-md-undefined col-lg-3 ","a":{"id":""}}]}]}]},{"t":"section","c":"sc-a0aea947-0 bnRfCD section-class  ","a":{"id":"1e6fcfe7-b8f1-4ee9-817a-8eaa53406fee"},"ch":[{"t":"div","c":"sc-a0aea947-0 dOqGpd container ","a":{"id":""},"ch":[{"t":"div","c":"sc-a0aea947-0 dOqGpd row justify-content-none align-items-none ","a":{"id":""}}]}]},{"t":"section","c":"sc-a0aea947-0 bnRfCD section-class  ","a